///| Red-team (`redteam_*`, FAIL while the defect exists) and control (`control_*`, must PASS) tests for
///| `packages/wgsl` @ f1bb2c4. Case bodies live in `src/cases.pion` so `wgsl_audit selftest` runs the same code
///| on native and wasm32. A fix is complete when every test passes without editing `audit/`.

